/* ── the wide banner beneath the tier grid, for community/enterprise/commercial
 * builds ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 * Distinct from CustomPlanTile above (the compact "Build your own" tile that
 * sits IN the grid, for a one-off custom size) — this is the pitch for
 * something bigger than any of the four ready-made tiers: a community's flagship
 * server, a paid/branded server network, or a commercial deployment. It opens
 * the SAME CustomServerBuilder underneath (which already has its own escalation
 * to sales for anything past the self-serve ceiling) — this card exists purely
